    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/1.png?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><br><strong>Tense Reflection</strong> is an innovative puzzle / shooter where you need to solve puzzles in order to reload your ammo / change the color of your shots.<br><br>In order to win, you must quickly switch between <strong>3 panels</strong>\u00a0:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/65590813307867731e02e88c44a904c9.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/b93ddb45ed0b1bdcd066190c6a0636f3.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/cf266f921f98163c716704a02f0222d8.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br>In Tense Reflection, you will never be able to slow down. Keep going, stay focus, and good luck.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/936fd251cd288326d315f7b8bb19df29.webp?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><br>The game features a colorblind mode.<br><br>Tense Reflection features musics from the 7 following artists\u00a0:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/178e386c58cdb757961936a4a73fba60.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/ec197d7b88e0d9dc68a1d0e3fd037c1c.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/1.png?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><br><strong>Tense Reflection</strong> is an innovative puzzle / shooter where you need to solve puzzles in order to reload your ammo / change the color of your shots.<br><br>In order to win, you must quickly switch between <strong>3 panels</strong>\u00a0:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/65590813307867731e02e88c44a904c9.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/b93ddb45ed0b1bdcd066190c6a0636f3.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/cf266f921f98163c716704a02f0222d8.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br>In Tense Reflection, you will never be able to slow down. Keep going, stay focus, and good luck.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/936fd251cd288326d315f7b8bb19df29.webp?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><br>The game features a colorblind mode.<br><br>Tense Reflection features musics from the 7 following artists\u00a0:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/178e386c58cdb757961936a4a73fba60.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/ec197d7b88e0d9dc68a1d0e3fd037c1c.avif?t=1634886067\" /></div>",
